(=-Wint-in-bool-context=) once for each instantiation: building
=23.bitset= prints it ten times, and so does any program that
instantiates =bitset= under =-Wall=. From the 2005 import (e6c7726b).
Seen in passing while building =23.bitset=, 2026-11-05.

