Also: =C.UTF-8= has =frac_digits= 127; on the C-library path
(=RWSTD_LOCALE_ROOT= pointing nowhere) =money_put= throws
=runtime_error= from =include/loc/_money_put.cc= 197, on the database
path it writes nothing (round 2 worker, by probe, 2026-11-02). The
