are unchanged.

** TODO The transliteration page and its dead reader

=doc/notes/plan-localedef-backend.md= 2.2 decided (d): drop the
section and the dead reader, =xliteration_off= in
=include/loc/_localedef.h= (line 89), =__rw_xlit= and the guarded
block in =src/wcodecvt.cpp= (181, 638-645), "with the removal of the
old compiler", as the first format commit after acceptance. The
removal (ec1b536d) did not; the writer still emits the empty page
(=util/localedef/wcodecvt.cpp= 195-197). Found by the documentation
sweep of 2026-11-02.

Fix: the format change the plan decided: the field, the reader and
the empty page go together.

Check: every codecvt database rebuilt; =22.locale.codecvt= on its
pin; the =sizeof= of =__rw_codecvt_t= in the plan's 1.3 updated.

